> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siōng-sīm-láng bo-bak-sài\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>總<rt>정ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>多情<rt>도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’랗\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jông-si-gùn tō-jiéng’lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>遮邇<rt>쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby>軟<rt>능ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiâh-ni-nn̂g-sīm-koâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>奈<rt>내ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>煞<rt>쇃</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jê-bo-nāi’e kâm-jiéng jiâh-e-bo-lai-bo-soah\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到今<rt>ᄀᅷˋ달ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>算<rt>승</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>十<rt>잡-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>冬<rt>당ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-tâ̰ sng’lai jap-roa-tâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>等待<rt>단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby>花蕊<rt>훼ˉ뤼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶未<rt>얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby>紅<rt>앙ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tân-thai-huē-lùi yâh-bue-áng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>原諒<rt>꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby>多情<rt>도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goan-liong-tō-jiéng’e goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ru